                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \wedge B \in F
          %p
            Here, (1) is equivalent to the previous version; the others, which here say that the lattice is closed under finite
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/meets"} meets
          %p
            You can also interpret these axioms to say that, if you think of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
